WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:04.570
I will correct mankind and take back my mother.

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:07.580
That is my duty.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:15.710
The gods will likely use your child in this war.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.420
If your child joins them, he will die as well.

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:22.010
Stop it. Don't pick on Jeanne.

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:24.550
You haven't changed.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:26.970
What? What do you know!

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:29.390
Would you dance with me again?

00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:48.620
You have my thanks.

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:52.370
I never would've imagined you'd be
with the saint.

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:54.870
I am no longer a saint.

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:58.340
Rita, you always show up
right when I need you!

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.300
Let us hurry!

00:01:21.190 --> 00:01:25.360
Rage of Bahamut

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:35.730
In the past,

00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:39.150
we had a favorable relationship with mankind.

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:43.150
During the Bahamut catastrophe
10 years ago,

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:46.740
we took each other by the hand,
and made heavy sacrifices

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:49.530
to successfully defend the world
from oblivion.

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:53.910
But despite this,
mankind lost its way

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:58.540
claiming it no longer needed the gods.
Men attacked our shrines,

00:02:58.710 --> 00:03:01.460
and even dared to kill
our brothers and sisters.

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:05.130
Should we simply suffer this oppression in silence

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:10.300
until mankind realizes its mistake?

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:11.800
I say no.

00:03:11.970 --> 00:03:15.810
We can no longer forgive mankind's
domineering ways.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:22.110
We must admonish those
who have wronged us.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:31.740
We must avenge our fallen comrades
and restore balance to the world.

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:52.930
Gabriel.

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:55.300
El's powers are still unknown.

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:58.560
Can he withstand this war?

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:00.890
There is no need to worry.

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:03.650
El has shown to be capable of

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:06.900
stripping the humans of their powers
on multiple occasions. But...

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:12.860
We have no other choice.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.750
Air brigade! Go, go!

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:37.930
Ground forces, prepare the ballistic weapons!

00:04:38.390 --> 00:04:40.980
Concentrate our forces to the front!

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:42.980
Get the golems in position!

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:46.400
Charioce shall die!

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:49.690
The royal capital's soldiers shall be defeated!

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:54.070
If they're going to make war,
I'd wish they'd do it somewhere else!

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:57.870
Shut up! We gotta get out of here
before all hell breaks loose!

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:11.050
This battle will give us the chance
to prove our worth.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:15.180
Does fighting the gods
not give you any pause?

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:17.800
What? What about it?

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:21.850
Honestly, please don't go all
Captain Kaisar on me.

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:24.690
The gods are the ones who declared war on us.

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:26.310
We can't back down now.

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:29.860
Thanks, you guys.

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:32.110
Do a good job guarding our flanks, okay?

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:34.900
We'll be the ones on the front lines.

00:05:35.070 --> 00:05:36.280
What?

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:39.740
You precious humans
can watch us from safety.

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:41.790
What did you say?

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:47.830
It's what your king decided.

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:53.880
What was with his attitude?

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:56.970
Dias, teach him some manners!

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:03.140
This way!

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:22.830
Through here!

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:31.380
Fire! Fire!

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:32.550
Fire!

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:38.050
Jeanne!

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:40.430
Why you little...!

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:46.560
Nina!

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:49.900
You go on ahead, I'll hold them off here!

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:52.820
Will you be okay?

00:06:52.980 --> 00:06:56.070
Don't worry, it won't take me long
to catch up to you. I'm fast.

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:57.570
Let's go.

00:06:58.570 --> 00:06:59.820
Be careful!

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:04.080
All right! Bring it on!

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:14.000
If we go any further,

00:07:14.170 --> 00:07:16.090
Nina won't know which direction to take.

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:31.020
Fire!

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:00.590
Rita!

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:02.640
Jeanne!

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:17.980
Good timing, right?
You guys okay?

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:22.110
I wonder where this leads to.

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:23.530
I do not know.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:25.700
I have never been this far either.

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:40.460
Nina!

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:49.890
What are you dancing for?

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:52.520
Well...

00:08:57.650 --> 00:08:59.400
Would you dance with me again?

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:07.160
-Nina!
-Nina, the brake!

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:09.660
Okay! This?

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:16.540
Oh, no!

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:21.340
Everyone, hold on tight!

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:43.030
Is anyone hurt?

00:09:43.570 --> 00:09:45.950
No, I am fine.

00:09:46.610 --> 00:09:47.660
What about Nina?

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:54.460
I thought I was dead.

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:59.710
Hey!
What are you doing there?

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:01.210
Men?

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:11.060
What the hell is all that racket?

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:12.520
Has something happened?

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:15.350
-Stop right there!
-Get back here!

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:17.980
Those crazy...

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:25.690
Why do you think they're cheering us on?

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:27.820
-What?
-I don't know!

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:35.450
Rage of Bahamut

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:14.290
So they've come.

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:24.340
Look up there!

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:00.120
Commence the attack.

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:23.350
El.

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:12.710
Protect His Majesty!

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:36.200
Time-out.
Aren't these gods way too strong?

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:40.410
This light is stripping us of our power.

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:43.540
What are the Onyx Soldiers doing?

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:47.290
I thought handling this type of enemy
is their specialty!

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:59.340
Even they are no match to this light.

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:02.100
Is that why they ran?

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:30.750
Your Highness, they have broken through
the castle gates.

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:33.420
It will not be long before they are at the castle.

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:37.210
We will use the device.

00:15:40.220 --> 00:15:43.970
Forgive me, Your Highness,
but the device is still in development!

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:48.600
If it is used now, there is no telling what
it might do or what danger it may put you in.

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:51.940
I did not ask for your opinion.

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:56.940
I told you to get it ready.

00:15:58.070 --> 00:15:59.570
At once, Your Highness!

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:17.840
All right, I guess we should get going too.

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:22.180
-Kaisar, take off your iron hand.
-Why?

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:23.720
Just hurry up and do it.

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:28.720
Once you take it off,
fasten it to the lock.

00:16:28.890 --> 00:16:30.770
Stretch out the thumb first,

00:16:31.270 --> 00:16:32.480
then the middle finger.

00:16:34.810 --> 00:16:36.270
What are you planning on doing?

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:39.150
What do you mean?
We're escaping of course.

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:42.740
Next, bend the thumb and stretch out
the index and pinkie fingers.

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:53.420
All right, now, get as far away from it
as you can!

00:16:57.630 --> 00:16:59.000
Hey! What are you doing?

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:01.170
Hurry! Hurry up and step back!

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:18.980
Look at your face.

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:21.070
Don't worry, I'll make you a better one.

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:26.160
Could you grab that guy's keys
and unlock this cell for me?

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:32.870
I'd like my next hand to be
one that won't explode.

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:37.500
That wasn't me, Rita was the one who built that in
because she was worried about you.

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:39.590
She was worried?

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:40.920
It exploded!

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:43.090
Stop right there!

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.410
What was that sound?

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:00.750
Everyone's gone!

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:06.300
Let's go.

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:18.520
Rita!

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:20.440
Lady Jeanne!

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:22.560
Kaisar!

00:19:22.860 --> 00:19:24.570
Hey, wow!

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:26.190
What are you doing here?

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:30.950
You're a bit more developed now,
aren't you, Nina?

00:19:33.160 --> 00:19:34.450
What are you looking at?

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:36.200
Lady Jeanne,

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:38.370
I'm glad to see you safe.

00:19:38.830 --> 00:19:39.870
Kaisar,

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:41.790
I am glad to see you as well.

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:46.880
Hello?

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:49.550
You guys know we don't
have time for this, right?

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:53.220
What is that?

00:19:59.270 --> 00:20:00.390
Oh, crap!

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:54.070
It's okay, it's okay
I cast the usual spell

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:58.200
Stagnation, stagnation
My words and heart are at odds

00:20:58.370 --> 00:21:02.080
Default
I've taken all the paint

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:06.500
And mixed up all the colors
Until you're left with me

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:08.840
So fragile
Yet strong

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:10.960
Close to overflowing
But not spilling

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:14.970
Because I'm incomplete
I won't amount to much

00:21:15.140 --> 00:21:19.220
This is just a good luck charm
I'm not asking for your help

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:23.350
This is just a good luck charm
I was just clinging to you

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:27.610
Let's end it all today

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:31.900
I'm done living this pointless life

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:35.910
Let's end it all today

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:40.740
I've taken my last, pointless breath

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:49.540
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye
I killed the person I was yesterday

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:54.380
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye

00:21:54.550 --> 00:22:01.390
A new morning is coming

00:23:46.660 --> 00:23:50.210
-Nina! Have you brushed up lately?
-Brushed up to the max!

00:23:50.370 --> 00:23:51.830
See? How about this? And that!

00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:53.590
Oh, so you're talking about your skin...

00:23:53.750 --> 00:23:57.590
Next time on Rage of Bahamut: Virgin Soul,
"A Farewell to Arms."

00:23:57.760 --> 00:24:00.010
Like shooting...
That was my bad.

00:24:00.180 --> 00:24:01.180
No worries, Master.

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:03.970
Baha Soul...???

00:24:04.140 --> 00:24:05.600
Baha Baha Baha Soul

00:24:05.970 --> 00:24:07.600
Watch next time too!

00:24:08.220 --> 00:24:10.520
Ba Baha Baha Baha Soul?
